{
  "behaviorChanges": [
    "Dependabot is disabled in THIS repository by operator decision: an automated vector that pushes dependency changes into the product without the operator's approval is not wanted for now. The config is renamed to `.github/dependabot.yml.disabled` rather than deleted, so it and its caveats survive; renaming it back is the whole re-enable.",
    "The trade is stated in the disabled file rather than left implicit: no automatic notice when a dependency ships a SECURITY fix, and pins drift silently. `.github/workflows/npm-audit.yml` still reports known npm advisories, so the JS side keeps a watcher; pip and github-actions have none while this is off.",
    "Adopter-visible surface is unchanged. `.github/dependabot.yml` is excluded from the public release export, so no adopter tree ever contained it and none changes here."
  ],
